<p>I won't tell you you're wrong, since we are all entitled to our own opinions and can downvote for whatever reason we damn well please, but I do register a very strong disagreement as to this characterization:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>You could remove all references to AWCY? from this piece and not change in it the least.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>IMHO without the narrative context this would be a much lesser piece. Might as well get rid of the historical context as well and just have a collage that eats people. That would be <em>just</em> as good&#8230;. Sorry, I just don't think so.</p>
<hr />
<p>Unless what you're saying is that if the AWCY? was replaced by some random group unrelated to anything else&#8230; In which case I still don't think so. Besides being a pointless change, it would eliminate the climatic pun.</p>

